# ============================================================================
# Range E : F_10960 .. F_14780  (render modules, HUD, results, screen, spinner,
# starfield, dirty-cell restore). Written by agent E.
# Module life cycle: every render module has Init (called once by F_107e2 at
# program start), Begin (called by Render_InitAll at each round start) and
# DeInit (called by Render_FreeAll at program exit). Many are empty rts hooks.
# "Low memory" below means F_0aac0 returned 1 (machine has less than 2 MB):
# then many graphics are not kept resident but come from the GfxBank groups.
# ============================================================================

# ---- Render module list ----------------------------------------------------

# ---- GfxBank : graphics file groups (for machines with < 2 MB) --------------
F_10a6c GfxBank_Init
@GfxBank_Init GfxBank_Init() : clear the 5 file groups of GfxBankFileTable (35 entries of
@GfxBank_Init 18 bytes: +0 packed data, +4 unpacked data, +8 file size, +$c unpacked size,
@GfxBank_Init +$10 loaded flag, +$11 unpacked flag). On low memory, allocate one shared
@GfxBank_Init depack buffer as big as the largest group and preload every group packed.
F_10b20 GfxBank_DeInit
@GfxBank_DeInit GfxBank_DeInit() : free the files of the 5 groups and the shared depack buffer.
F_10b46 GfxBank_LoadGroup
@GfxBank_LoadGroup GfxBank_LoadGroup(d0 = group 0-4) : load (packed) every file of the group
@GfxBank_LoadGroup not loaded yet. A packed file gets a slice of the shared depack buffer
@GfxBank_LoadGroup as its unpacked address; an unpacked file is used in place.
F_10c92 GfxBank_DepackGroup
@GfxBank_DepackGroup GfxBank_DepackGroup(d0 = group) : copy each packed file of the group into its
@GfxBank_DepackGroup slice of the shared buffer and depack it there (marks it unpacked).
F_10d18 GfxBank_ReleaseGroup
@GfxBank_ReleaseGroup GfxBank_ReleaseGroup(d0 = group) : mark the group's files as no longer
@GfxBank_ReleaseGroup unpacked (the shared buffer is about to be reused by another group).
F_10d62 GfxBank_FreeGroup
@GfxBank_FreeGroup GfxBank_FreeGroup(d0 = group) : Memory_Free every loaded file of the group.
F_10dc2 GfxBank_GetGroupSize
@GfxBank_GetGroupSize d0.l = GfxBank_GetGroupSize(d0 = group) : total unpacked size of the
@GfxBank_GetGroupSize group's files (read from the link file directory).
F_10e0c GfxBank_GetFile
@GfxBank_GetFile a0 = GfxBank_GetFile(d0 = group, d1 = file index) : unpacked data of that file.
F_10e30 GfxBank_SelectGroup
@GfxBank_SelectGroup GfxBank_SelectGroup(d0 = group) : low memory only. Makes a group resident in
@GfxBank_SelectGroup the shared buffer (release old, load + depack new), then lets the modules
@GfxBank_SelectGroup re-fetch their sprite pointers: 0 congrats, 1 front end, 2 in-game
@GfxBank_SelectGroup (Pause/Hud/Spinner), 3 level select, 4 results.
B_2d796 gGfxBankGroups
@gGfxBankGroups 5 pointers to the first entry of each group inside gGfxBankEntries.
B_2d7aa gGfxBankEntries
B_2da20 gGfxBankBuffer
B_2da28 gGfxBankCurrent
D_1b136 GfxBankFileTable
@GfxBankFileTable 5 words = files per group (1,11,10,8,5) then 5 pointers to (id, name)
@GfxBankFileTable lists: 0 CONGRATS.BSB, 1 front end (FRONT.PI1, FLAME.GFX...), 2 in game
@GfxBankFileTable (PAUSE, SPINNER, SPINEDGE, ARROWBOX, PUZBUT1/0, SCMODE, TIMEPANL, ROCKTIME,
@GfxBankFileTable PUZPANEL), 3 level select (LEV*.BSB, SELECT.PI1), 4 results (STAGCOMP...TIMEBIT).

