F_1376a Screen_Swap
@Screen_Swap Screen_Swap() : show the buffer just drawn (flip index, set video base), wait VBLs
@Screen_Swap until at least gFrameMinTicks 200 Hz ticks passed since the last swap, and handle
@Screen_Swap keypad 4/6 (Falcon horizontal centring).
